# Written by /mentor-sync into .mentor/.gitignore on bootstrap.
#
# Everything in .mentor/ is version-controlled except session-derived output.
# The state that matters — domain declarations, the node registry, the
# Gemini Notebook snapshot, and the feature maps — is small, diffable, and is the
# audit trail for every verdict the skill produced. It belongs in git.

# /mentor-class artifacts: regenerable session output, sometimes large
# (audio, HTML). The index.md beside them IS tracked — it is the record
# that a class happened; the artifact is not.
features/*/classes/*
!features/*/classes/index.md
